"B<EOF> or a newline.  If a newline is read, it is stored into the buffer.  A "
"terminating null byte (\\[aq]\\[rs]0\\[aq])  is stored after the last "
"character in the buffer."
msgstr ""
"B<fgets>()  は I<stream> から最大で I<size> - 1 個の文字を読み込み、 I<s> が"
