"B<wait4>(2)  returns an error, or some other error is detected, -1 is "
"returned."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/popen.3:128
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "In the event of an error, both system calls return -1 and set I<errno> to "
#| "indicate the cause of the error."
